Enumeration InterventionEffectivenessRating
    documentation 'An intervention demonstrates effectiveness if the research has shown that the 
    'program caused an improvement in outcomes. Rating Values: positive effects, 
    'potentially positive effects, mixed effects, potentially negative effects, 
    'negative effects and no discernible effects.
    item Positive Effects
    item Potentially Positive Effects
    item Mixed Effects
    item Potentially Negative Effects
    item Negative Effects
    item No Discernible Effects
	item Other
